    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Text Styles\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. **Learn:** Ask AI Tutor to explain how `font-size`, `font-weight`, and `text-decoration` work in CSS.\r\n2. **Style:** Ask AI Tutor to **update the headers and paragraphs** using these properties.\r\n   - Example: *\"Make the headings bold with a `font-size` of...\"*\r\n\r\nOnce you've styled the page and accepted the changes, click **Continue**.",
